      "why_relevant": "The post analyzes why eVTOL programs follow different development timelines, focusing on early technical and organizational decisions, suppliers, testing infrastructure, certification paths, and scaling processes. This closely aligns with the profile's eVTOL, flight-control, simulation, and multidisciplinary aerospace engineering background. The author also states having 34 years in aerospace and experience with eVTOL aircraft that flew, making him a relevant person to follow or connect with.",
